{
  "name": "realtime-systems",
  "description": "Build a realtime feature end to end: choose the transport, define protocol, versioning, close codes, auth, heartbeat, backpressure and delivery guarantees, implement the server for the chosen stack, scale out with Redis, configure the proxy, drain on deploy, build the reconnecting reconciling client, fault-test it and load-test it to a capacity report.",
